Task 3
1. public means it is accessible everywhere in the php code.
2. private means it is accessible only inside the class.
3. protected means it is accessible only inside the class and its children.
4. extends is the keyword to inheritance in php programming language.
5. parent class is the class where children inherit from its properties and methods like Employee and Person
6. child is inheriting from the parent class like Manager and Student
7. protected gives access to children but limits accessing it outside of class and anywhere else.
